<p>Well, I mean, I have a weird relationship with pizza. If I were to choose, it'd largely be dependent on the day of the week. My answer is as follow:</p>
<p><strong>Sunday:</strong> Definitely a Pepperoni day, but only on a thin crust.<br />
<strong>Monday:</strong> I mean, Monday isn't really a pizza day, but if I were to get pizza, it'd likely be cheese.<br />
<strong>Tuesday:</strong> Meat lovers! Definitely meat lovers<br />
<strong>Wednesday:</strong> Wednesday is always a wild card, I leave no answer. It'd dependent on the mood I'm in.<br />
<strong>Thursday:</strong> I wouldn't want pizza on a Thursday. It's such a boring day, and I'd likely want literally <em>anything</em> else.<br />
<strong>Friday:</strong> Pepperoni! Easy answer!<br />
<strong>Saturday:</strong> Extra cheese with a half pepperoni half meat lovers thingie.</p>
<p>Welp, theres my take!</p>

